{
  "language": "en_us",
  "openings": [
    "Here lies {name}.",
    "{name}: {duration} of stolen light.",
    "Life {number}. {name}.",
    "They called this one {name}.",
    "{name} burned for {duration}.",
    {
      "text": "This one had no name.",
      "when": {
        "nameless": true
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nameless, weightless, unwitnessed.",
      "when": {
        "nameless": true
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There was no one yet to ask his name.",
      "when": {
        "nameless": true,
        "max_life": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{name} had no time to become someone.",
      "when": {
        "max_minutes": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{name}. Barely a breath.",
      "when": {
        "max_minutes": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{name}, who lasted {duration} and filled them all.",
      "when": {
        "min_minutes": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{name}, star number {number}.",
      "when": {
        "min_life": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Another one. {name}.",
      "when": {
        "min_life": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{name}, who walked among the Gods.",
      "when": {
        "min_rank": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Here ends {name}, and with him the Father.",
      "when": {
        "victory": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "bodies": [
    "Rank {rank}, {kills} dead in his wake.",
    "He followed {path} as far as it led.",
    "He kept {absorption} inside him.",
    "He took {kills} lives and kept none.",
    {
      "text": "He killed nothing and was nothing.",
      "when": {
        "max_kills": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He had time to learn only hunger.",
      "when": {
        "max_kills": 2,
        "max_rank": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His blade spoke for him.",
      "when": {
        "path": "lame"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He made fire his only tongue.",
      "when": {
        "path": "feu"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He was almost never seen coming.",
      "when": {
        "path": "ombre"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He took what would have killed ten men.",
      "when": {
        "path": "endurance"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He saw what would kill him, from very far away.",
      "when": {
        "path": "perception"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He outran his sentence, for a while.",
      "when": {
        "path": "vitesse"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He bit, clawed, hunted: a beast among beasts.",
      "when": {
        "path": "bete"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He bent the world with other people's magic.",
      "when": {
        "path": "arcane"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He killed from afar, cleanly.",
      "when": {
        "path": "distance"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He left a winter behind him.",
      "when": {
        "path": "givre"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The dead lent him their patience.",
      "when": {
        "path": "mort"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His blood turned to poison, and he used it.",
      "when": {
        "path": "venin"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He carried the light of dead stars.",
      "when": {
        "path": "astral"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He devoured his own family.",
      "when": {
        "path": "divin"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{kills} dead: nearly a war all by himself.",
      "when": {
        "min_kills": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He felled names thought eternal.",
      "when": {
        "min_uniques": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kingdoms will mourn him without knowing his face.",
      "when": {
        "min_uniques": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He reached rank {rank}: enough to be feared.",
      "when": {
        "min_rank": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He killed Higgs. There is nothing to add.",
      "when": {
        "victory": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "closings": [
    "Killed by {killer}, at {place}.",
    "{killer} ended it, at {place}.",
    "He went out at {place}. He will light again.",
    "Death kept only the body.",
    "He will remember.",
    {
      "text": "The world itself saw to it, at {place}.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "world"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fall, a flame, a trifle: the world sufficed.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "world"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mere beast, {killer}, was enough.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "beast"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{killer} was only a beast. He will remember.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "beast",
        "max_rank": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A peasant. A mere peasant.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "peasant"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A nameless soldier did what no God had deigned to do.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "soldier"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A knight sent him back where he came from.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "knight"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A spell undid him, cast by {killer}.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "mage"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{killer}, Supernova, showed him what a perfected mortal is.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "supernova"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{killer}, Hypernova: he was not yet on that scale.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "hypernova"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Segaroth had a thousand years' head start.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "emperor"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{killer}, demigod, crushed him at {place}.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "demigod"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{killer}, of his own blood, sent him back into the past.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "god"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A God had to step in: {killer}. That alone is a confession.",
      "when": {
        "killer_category": "god"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Father is dead. So is he, but he will return.",
      "when": {
        "victory": true
      }
    }
  ]
